                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hey frog, I don't know if this is your first game or not, if so it's not bad for a first game! But! nothing about it was fun for me... I played 30 minutes, and realized that I think the bugs should kill these dumb green guys... Like, this game as a few glitches, nothing that is a problem, but the game it's self... Please, if you wish to make more games in the future, do something... More? This was so bad for me, I can't imagine anyone who would sit down for a good 30 minute sesh, finish this game and go \"Did someone say Tipod Challenge?\" Because I got a migraine, though I did do everything I could... I also realized the map is surrounded by HUGE amounts of open unused map... I give this game a 3/10, I mean, I did play 30 minutes of it for the video.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BI6zx5eg9_M&feature=youtu.be",
